  "summary": "Distribution of rib CSA by rib number and sex (Fig 7 top); Fig 7 bottom gives age groups, Fig 8 model predictions (not digitised).",
  "how_to_use": [
   "Assign total rib CSA ~65-95 mm² (female) and ~87-131 mm² (male) depending on rib number (rib 2 smallest, ribs 7 and 11 largest).",
   "This is the total section area, not cortical area: derive cortical shell thickness separately (~1 mm, not resolvable here).",
   "CSA decreases with age in every rib (Fig 7 bottom; linear mixed model age p<0.0001) – reduce for elderly models."
  ],
